# lucent-bridge release pinned into the image. The build downloads the RPM
# for its architecture from the GitHub release, checks it against the
# release's SHA256SUMS *and* against these pinned hashes, then installs it
# with dnf. To update: bump the version, paste the two RPM lines from the
# new release's SHA256SUMS.
